 "remarks": "Bright and immaculate condo in a super convenient location! This home offers two spacious bedrooms and two full baths, including a primary suite with not one but two walk-in closets. You'll love the modern vinyl flooring throughout, custom window treatments, and a stylish kitchen with leathered granite counters and stainless steel appliances. The living and dining areas feature crown molding for an extra touch of charm. The unit also comes with two reserved garage spaces plus a storage unit. Best of all, you can walk to Target, Wegmans, Costco, and plenty of other great stores, and you're just over a mile from the Rowayton train station. Everyday living doesn't get much easier than this! BEST OFFERS BY MON 9/8 10am",
